Notes: Pinned snapshot of the Python diffcp source that this R port
  tracks. Per-file `## DIFFCP SOURCE:` headers reference paths inside
  this upstream tree. The CVXPY constraint is diffcp's own runtime
  dependency on the Python side; the R port has no direct CVXPY
  dependency but ships into a CVXR ecosystem aligned to a CVXPY
  version (see CVXR's own DESCRIPTION/Config fields).
